# autotest alpha.10 batch G (lane SC2, 2026-11-24). Written against the Feature text with sha 6dc95311ece43c0a; honest subset only: what a screen or the guest shows is under clause, everything else under not-covered.
row: F-CLUSTER-03
targets: qemu
profile: ram
feature-sha: 6dc95311ece43c0a
doc: Settings, Clusters is the page of the cluster switcher (read only)
clause: 1 Settings, Clusters is a page of its own that shows the active cluster
not-covered: the drop-down with the active cluster's name and a status dot
not-covered: switching between clusters (a scratch guest has no cluster)
key s
wait app=Settings
skip-unless-button Clusters
click-sidebar Clusters
wait app=Settings page="Clusters"
shot page
expect-not-blank
expect-text Clusters
expect-page Clusters
